      "text": "🇦🇲The \"Armenia\" bloc will challenge the results of the shameful parliamentary elections\n\n - The elections took place under the conditions of widespread pressure from the Pashinyan regime, arrests of opposition members, unprecedented use of administrative resources, and electoral violations, stated the leader of the \"Armenia\" bloc and former president of the country Robert Kocharyan.\n\n - Pashinyan's party scored 49.82% and, according to the shameful Constitution of Armenia, it now has a decisive majority in parliament, thanks to the redistribution of votes from parties that did not make it into the legislative body.\n\n - \"And thanks to the same shameful Constitution in the history of Armenia, he will have 60% there. Only in Armenia does a party that did not win the majority of votes get 60% in parliament. Obviously, Pashinyan doesn't have a popular mandate for anything (less than 50%), but he does have a 3/5 majority in parliament\", explain Armenian sources.\n\n@Slavyangrad",
